  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "The two Extra workflow failures stop at the PR gate with `Missing required label 'run-ci'`; their build/test jobs are skipped. Lint passed. Gate logs: [Extra](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39127795101/job/117676558753), [AMD Extra](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39127795099/job/117676484363).\n\nCould a maintainer review this Docker-only change and enable the appropriate CI labels/checks? The change adds only the HF download cache and preserves the existing metadata-resolution and runtime-copy behavior.",
